algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: Certified Charge Extraction
Input:  Finite set X = {0,...,n-1}, bijective dynamics tau, symmetries Sigma = {sigma_1,...,sigma_k}
Output: Certified conserved charges {Q_1,...,Q_k}

for i = 1 to k:
    for x = 0 to n-1:
        Q_i(x) := [sigma_i(x) = x]
    // Certificate: Q_i(tau(x)) = Q_i(x) by Fixed-Point Conservation Theorem
return {Q_1,...,Q_k}

Complexity: O(k * n) time, O(k * n) space
